मम देहे गुडाकेश यच्च‍ान्यद्‍द्रष्टुमिच्छसि ॥ ७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3165,\"bb\":2796,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/7/b2796/\",\"body_value\":\"ihaika-sthaṁ jagat kṛtsnaṁ
paśyādya sa-carācaram
mama dehe guḍākeśa
yac cānyad draṣṭum icchasi\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3166,\"bb\":2797,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/7/b2797/\",\"shadow_value\":\"iha – in this; eka-stham – in one place; jagat – the universe; kṛtsnam – completely; paśya – see; adya – immediately; sa – with; cara – the moving; acaram – and not moving; mama – My; dehe – in this body; guḍākeśa – O Arjuna; yat – that which; ca – also; anyat – other; draṣṭum – to see; icchasi – you wish.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"iha\",\"translation\":\"in this\"},{\"word\":\"eka-stham\",\"translation\":\"in one place\"},{\"word\":\"jagat\",\"translation\":\"the universe\"},{\"word\":\"kṛtsnam\",\"translation\":\"completely\"},{\"word\":\"paśya\",\"translation\":\"see\"},{\"word\":\"adya\",\"translation\":\"immediately\"},{\"word\":\"sa\",\"translation\":\"with\"},{\"word\":\"cara\",\"translation\":\"the moving\"},{\"word\":\"acaram\",\"translation\":\"and not moving\"},{\"word\":\"mama\",\"translation\":\"My\"},{\"word\":\"dehe\",\"translation\":\"in this body\"},{\"word\":\"guḍākeśa\",\"translation\":\"O Arjuna\"},{\"word\":\"yat\",\"translation\":\"that which\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"anyat\",\"translation\":\"other\"},{\"word\":\"draṣṭum\",\"translation\":\"to see\"},{\"word\":\"icchasi\",\"translation\":\"you wish\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3167,\"bb\":2798,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/7/b2798/\",\"body_value\":\"O Arjuna, whatever you wish to see, behold at once in this body of Mine! This universal form can show you whatever you now desire to see and whatever you may want to see in the future. Everything – moving and nonmoving – is here completely, in one place.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3168,\"bb\":2799,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/7/b2799/\",\"body_value\":\"No one can see the entire universe while sitting in one place. Even the most advanced scientist cannot see what is going on in other parts of the universe. But a devotee like Arjuna can see everything that exists in any part of the universe. Kṛṣṇa gives him the power to see anything he wants to see, past, present and future. Thus by the mercy of Kṛṣṇa, Arjuna is able to see everything.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 11.7\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 11.7\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\